  "sourceTitle": "Chicken Curry Bake",
  "sourceText": "Chicken Curry Bake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 12:37am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n8 chicken breasts\n1/2 cup honey\n1/2 cup mustard\n1 tablespoon lemon juice\n1 tablespoon finely chopped onion\n1/2 teaspoon curry powder\n1/2 cup slivered almonds\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients, except almonds. Pour over chicken breasts; cover with foil. Bake at 400 degrees for 1/2 hour. Uncover; baste. Add almonds and bake 10 minutes more.",
  "parsedSource": {
