        "sourceText": "1/2 cup slivered almonds"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "text": "1 Mix all ingredients, except almonds. Pour over chicken breasts; cover with foil. Bake at 400 degrees for 1/2 hour. Uncover; baste. Add almonds and bake 10 minutes more."
